Write $H_i=a_i/D$ for $i=0,1,2,7$, and use $B_0,C_0,U,b,j,r$
from (5.5). The terminal functions of that same reconstructed world are

$$
\begin{aligned}
m&=d+(2x+3)a_7/D,\\
